{"seq":1,"slug":"fastturn-quality-inline","title":"快反在线质检与返工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/quickresponse-quality-ops/fastturn-quality-inline","wordCount":2409,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"快反在线质检与返工\">快反在线质检与返工</h1><p>按传统做法，一批货做完之后按抽样标准抽取若干件检验，合格就放行。这套方法的统计基础是<strong>批量足够大</strong>——样本量从批量推导，批量小到 100 件时，抽样能给出的结论几乎没有统计意义，而 100 件恰恰是快反的基本单位。所以快反的质量控制不能靠事后抽样，只能靠<strong>过程内的控制</strong>：把检验点前移进工序，用过程能力而不是批次合格率来判断这批货能不能出。这不是退让，而是把质量控制从「筛出次品」改成「不让次品产生」，后者在理论上更强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-抽样标准在小批量下的失效\">核心概念：抽样标准在小批量下的失效</h2><p>先看清失效的位置。通行的计数抽样标准（ISO 2859-1 及其对应的 ANSI/ASQ Z1.4）按批量与检验水平给出样本量与接收数，其前身 MIL-STD-105 于 1995 年废止时，废止通知推荐改用 MIL-STD-1916 或 ANSI/ASQ Z1.4（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIL-STD-105\">Wikipedia: MIL-STD-105</a>）。这些标准的共同假设是<strong>批内同质、样本可代表整批</strong>，而它们给出的样本量在批量下降时会急剧压缩——一个 100 件的批次，常规检验水平下的样本量常常只有个位数。</p>\n<p>个位数样本能提供的保证极其微弱：抽 5 件没发现次品，并不能推出批次不良率低于某个可接受水平。更糟的是，它在心理上给出了虚假的安心——「抽检合格了」被当成「这批没问题」。所以小批量场景正确的问题不是「抽几件」，而是「如果抽检给不出结论，我靠什么给结论」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种替代控制点\">三种替代控制点</h2><p>答案是三个前置的控制点，它们分别覆盖「开工前」「加工中」「完工后」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制点</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n<th>判定作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首件确认</td>\n<td>换款后首件</td>\n<td>尺寸、外观、工艺参数</td>\n<td>工艺是否就绪，不通过则不许批量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线巡检</td>\n<td>过程中按节拍</td>\n<td>关键质量点（技术包 critical_points）</td>\n<td>工艺是否漂移，漂移即停线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键工序全检</td>\n<td>该工序完成时</td>\n<td>不可逆或高风险工序</td>\n<td>该工序零缺陷放行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>首件确认</strong>是投入产出比最高的一环。它把「批量做错」的风险在批量开始前消掉——因为服装生产的问题八成是系统性的（版型错、参数错、物料错），这些问题在首件上就会暴露。首件不通过就返工调整，代价是几分钟；等到 100 件做完才发现，代价是 100 件。</p>\n<p><strong>在线巡检</strong>的作用是把质量控制从「事后筛」变成「过程控」。它的理论基础是控制图：沃特·休哈特在 1920 年代提出的控制图用<strong>控制限</strong>（通常为均值 ±3 标准差）区分<strong>普通原因波动</strong>与<strong>特殊原因波动</strong>，前者是过程固有、后者是需要追查的异常（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Control_chart\">Wikipedia: Control chart</a>）。关键的概念区分是：控制限来自过程自身的行为，与规格限（客户/设计要求）<strong>没有内在关系</strong>。很多工厂会把两者混淆，用规格限当控制限画在图上，于是永远看不出过程漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>关键工序全检</strong>针对不可逆的工序。绣花一旦绣错、裁剪一旦裁偏，返工成本极高甚至无法返工（裁片报废）。这类工序的全检成本低于返工成本，所以应当全检而不是抽检。判断标准是「返工成本 × 不良率」是否高于「全检成本」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[换款完成] --&gt; B[首件确认]&#10;  B --&gt;|不通过| C[调整工艺参数&lt;br/&gt;重新首件]&#10;  C --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| D[批量开工]&#10;  D --&gt; E[在线巡检&lt;br/&gt;按节拍抽关键点]&#10;  E --&gt; F{控制图是否报警}&#10;  F --&gt;|特殊原因| G[停线追查根因]&#10;  G --&gt; D&#10;  F --&gt;|正常| H[关键工序全检]&#10;  H --&gt; I{是否合格}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[返工或报废]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[完工入库]\">graph TD\n  A[换款完成] --&gt; B[首件确认]\n  B --&gt;|不通过| C[调整工艺参数&lt;br/&gt;重新首件]\n  C --&gt; B\n  B --&gt;|通过| D[批量开工]\n  D --&gt; E[在线巡检&lt;br/&gt;按节拍抽关键点]\n  E --&gt; F{控制图是否报警}\n  F --&gt;|特殊原因| G[停线追查根因]\n  G --&gt; D\n  F --&gt;|正常| H[关键工序全检]\n  H --&gt; I{是否合格}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[返工或报废]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[完工入库]</pre><h3 id=\"过程能力指标怎么用\">过程能力指标怎么用</h3><p>过程能力指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量的是过程在规格限内的实际能力，公式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>C</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{C}_{pk} = \\min\\left[\\frac{USL - \\hat{\\mu}}{3\\hat{\\sigma}},\\ \\frac{\\hat{\\mu} - LSL}{3\\hat{\\sigma}}\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2329em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p = (USL - LSL)/(6\\hat{\\sigma})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只衡量潜在能力、不考虑均值偏移（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Process_capability_index\">Wikipedia: Process capability index</a>）。常用的阈值是既有过程最低 1.33、新过程 1.50，安全关键项还要更高。对服装来说，尺寸是关键可量化的能力指标——一条缝制线的胸围尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低于 1.0 意味着它天然产出超差品，无论怎么抽检都堵不住。</p>\n<p>这两个指标必须<strong>在过程受控的前提下</strong>才有意义。一个失控过程中算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是幻觉——它把漂移混进了标准差。所以顺序是：先看控制图确认受控，再算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 判断能力。反过来做会得到「能力看起来还行」的错误结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"返工闭环与交期\">返工闭环与交期</h2><p>发现不合格只是开始，真正的难点是<strong>返工是否来得及</strong>。快反的交期本来就紧，返工消耗的时间可能直接导致延期。所以返工决策必须与交期联合考虑，而不是质量部门单独决定。</p>\n<p>返工的时间预算可以写成一条简单的不等式：可用返工时间 = 承诺交期 − 当前时点 − 剩余正常工序时间。如果可用返工时间小于返工所需时间，那么「返工」这个选项在交期上已经不可行，此时的选择只剩下三种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加班返工</td>\n<td>返工时间略超预算，且工序可延长</td>\n<td>加班成本、质量风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分返工 + 部分重做</td>\n<td>不良分散时，返工好件、重做坏件</td>\n<td>物料额外消耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通交期</td>\n<td>返工时间远超预算</td>\n<td>履约率受损、协商成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这三条做成显式规则，比让现场凭经验决定更可控——尤其是第二档「部分返工 + 部分重做」，它常常是最优但最容易被忽略的选项，因为现场容易陷入「整批返工」或「整批报废」的二选一思维。</p>\n<h3 id=\"返工与根因分析\">返工与根因分析</h3><p>每次都靠返工解决问题，是质量系统没有闭环的标志。返工记录必须能追溯到根因，否则同一类问题会反复发生。两个成熟工具在这里合用：<strong>鱼骨图</strong>（石川图）按下水的人、机、料、法、测、环分类展开可能原因（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ishikawa_diagram\">Wikipedia: Ishikawa diagram</a>），<strong>5 Whys</strong> 沿着因果链追问到底（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Five_whys\">Wikipedia: Five whys</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE defect_record (&#10;  id             bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  work_order_id  bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  factory_id     bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  stage          text        NOT NULL,    -- cutting / sewing / embroidery / finishing&#10;  defect_code    text        NOT NULL,    -- 缺陷编码，与技术包 critical_points 对应&#10;  qty_defective  integer     NOT NULL CHECK (qty_defective &gt; 0),&#10;  root_cause_cat text,                    -- man/machine/material/method/measurement/environment&#10;  root_cause_note text,&#10;  disposition    text        NOT NULL&#10;    CHECK (disposition IN (&#39;rework&#39;,&#39;replace&#39;,&#39;accept_deviation&#39;,&#39;scrap&#39;)),&#10;  recorded_at    timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX ON defect_record (factory_id, stage, defect_code, recorded_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defect_record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  work_order_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factory_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stage          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- cutting / sewing / embroidery / finishing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defect_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 缺陷编码，与技术包 critical_points 对应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_defective  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty_defective </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  root_cause_cat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- man/machine/material/method/measurement/environment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  root_cause_note </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disposition    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'replace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'accept_deviation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scrap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defect_record (factory_id, stage, defect_code, recorded_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表的索引设计服务于最常见的分析查询：某个工厂在某个工序上某类缺陷的时间趋势。有了这个趋势，根因分析才有数据基础——否则每次都在凭印象猜「是不是这批线有问题」。缺陷编码必须与技术包的 <code>critical_points</code> 用同一套体系，否则两边的数据对不上，这正是<a href=\"../small-batch-quick-response/small-batch-sample-quickturn\">小批量打样与快速首单</a>里强调技术包要写清关键质量点的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小批量下的质量成本权衡\">小批量下的质量成本权衡</h2><p>最后要正视一个问题：小批量、短交期的条件下，质量成本必然高于大批量。原因有三：首件确认的成本被摊销到更少的件数上；在线巡检的频次相对批量更高；返工的时间预算更紧，容易出现「为赶交期而让步放行」。</p>\n<p>这个成本不能被消除，只能被管理。管理的关键是<strong>把让步放行变成显式决策而不是默许行为</strong>——建立一个让步放行（concession/deviation）的记录与审批机制，让每一笔「不达标但放行」都有据可查。这样做的价值有两个：一是防止让步成为常态（一旦有记录，让步的频次就变成可考核的指标），二是让步的历史数据会成为下一轮工艺改进的输入——哪一类偏差被反复接受，说明规格本身可能设得过严。</p>\n<p>让步放行还有一个容易被忽视的用途：它是<strong>与工厂协商交期的筹码</strong>。当工厂说「这批货有一个尺寸超差 0.5cm，要返工就得延两天」时，平台如果事先定义了哪些偏差可接受、哪些不可接受，就能在几十秒内给出答复，而不是走一轮邮件。这套预先定义的可接受偏差清单，本质上是把质量谈判前置到了合作关系建立之时，而不是每次都临场博弈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>抽样标准（ISO 2859-1 / ANSI-ASQ Z1.4）在 100 件量级失效，小批量不能靠事后抽检给结论。</li>\n<li>三个前置控制点：首件确认（开工前）、在线巡检（加工中，用控制图判特殊原因）、关键工序全检（不可逆工序）。</li>\n<li>控制限来自过程自身行为，与规格限无内在关系，混淆两者会让漂移永远看不出来。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是潜在能力、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际能力；两者必须在过程受控的前提下解读，顺序是先受控再算能力。</li>\n<li>返工决策必须与交期联合，用「可用返工时间」不等式判断；部分返工 + 部分重做常被忽略但是最优解。</li>\n<li>返工记录要能追溯到根因（鱼骨图 + 5 Whys），缺陷编码与技术包关键质量点统一。</li>\n<li>让步放行要显式记录与审批，它既是防滥用的手段，也是与工厂协商交期的前置筹码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>质量之外的另一条约束是时间本身——工厂承诺了几号交货、这个承诺靠什么机制保证，见<a href=\"factory-delivery-commit\">工厂交期承诺与履约率</a>；而质量与交期的表现最终都要汇入协同 KPI 被度量，见<a href=\"agile-supply-kpi\">柔性供应链协同 KPI</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"快反在线质检与返工","id":"快反在线质检与返工"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：抽样标准在小批量下的失效","id":"核心概念-抽样标准在小批量下的失效"},{"level":2,"text":"三种替代控制点","id":"三种替代控制点"},{"level":3,"text":"过程能力指标怎么用","id":"过程能力指标怎么用"},{"level":2,"text":"返工闭环与交期","id":"返工闭环与交期"},{"level":3,"text":"返工与根因分析","id":"返工与根因分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小批量下的质量成本权衡","id":"小批量下的质量成本权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"面辅料协同与提前备料","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/c2m-order-factory/material-fabric-coordination"},"next":{"title":"工厂交期承诺与履约率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/quickresponse-quality-ops/factory-delivery-commit"}}